<title>USA: Zeigler Coal Holding Co profit vs loss.</title>
<headline>Zeigler Coal Holding Co profit vs loss.</headline>
<dateline>FAIRVIEW HEIGHTS, Ill. 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>(Amounts in thousands, except per share amounts)</p>
<p>				   Quarter Ended  Twelve Months Ended</p>
<p>					 December 31,   December 31,</p>
<p>				   1996	1995     1996	1995</p>
<p> Total revenues	    174,683  191,649   731,624   783,103</p>
<p>Provision for asset impairments,</p>
<p>  ccelerated mine closings    --   82,400	  --   114,662</p>
