<p> Net income (loss)	  18,186  (50,804)   57,964   (11,213)</p>
<p> Weighted avg shares	28,370   28,356    28,362    28,356</p>
<p> Earnings (loss) per share  0.64   (1.79)	2.04    (0.40)</p>
<p>NOTE: Q4 1996 profit includes after-tax $800,000 or $0.03 a share charge from revaluation of stock appreciation units. Operating profit before charge $0.67 a share.</p>
